document starts with one.\n- **`snippet`** (API-only, not persisted) — a plain-text summary truncated at 64 characters on a word boundary, with code blocks stripped. Computed by `GenerateSnippet` (`internal/markdown/markdown.go:263`).","iteration":20,"turn":1,"type":"assistant"}
